@startuml seq-mf03-hr-screening
title sd MF-03b: Internal HR Screens Application (Shortlist, Backup or Reject)
autonumber
hide footbox
actor "Internal HR" as HR
participant "Web App (HRConnect-FE)" as FE
participant "RecruitmentEndpoints" as API
participant "UpdateScreeningStatusHandler" as H
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
actor "Client Company User" as CL
HR -> FE : Open candidate application & inspect AI Match evidence
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/jobs/{jid}/applications/{aid}/start-screening
API -> DB : Update Application SUBMITTED -> SCREENING
API --> FE : 200 OK (Status: SCREENING)
HR -> FE : Select decision: SHORTLISTED, BACKUP, or REJECTED (+ reason)
FE -> API : PATCH /api/v1/jobs/{jid}/applications/{aid}/status (ConcurrencyToken)
API -> H : Send(UpdateApplicationScreeningStatusCommand)
alt Missing rejection reason or stale ConcurrencyToken
H --> API : Throw BadRequest / ConflictException
API --> FE : 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
else Valid Screening Decision
H -> DB : Update Application status, insert StatusHistory & AuditLog
H --> CL : Notify Client of newly SHORTLISTED candidate (masked CV)
H --> API : Return ApplicationStatusDto
API --> FE : 200 OK
end
@enduml
